{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run! Jump! Crouch! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character runs non-stop, and only your reflexes will help you overcome the deadly obstacles. Dozens of unique levels will challenge you. Death is not the end, but a chance to improve and finally win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984950/extras/eb394b1d9c9e48ebb4e51d876fd60937.poster.avif?t=1762378561\" width=1170 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984950/extras/eb394b1d9c9e48ebb4e51d876fd60937.webm?t=1762378561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984950/extras/eb394b1d9c9e48ebb4e51d876fd60937.mp4?t=1762378561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic gameplay:</strong> Simple controls \u2014 jump and crouch. But it will take time and skill to master it perfectly! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Voice control:</strong>\u00a0Experience a completely new gameplay by controlling your character with your voice. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New mechanics:</strong> Each new level is not only a different world, but also new mechanics: flight, river rafting, quicksand, etc. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural endless level:</strong> Each time a new infinitely generated level with constantly accelerating movement speed. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Achievements and awards:</strong>\u00a0Can you complete the game 100%? </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Editor:</strong> Completed all the levels and got bored!? Feel like a developer and share your levels with your friends. A convenient in-game editor will allow you to upload your level to the Steam workshop. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Workshop:</strong> Download other players levels and complete them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984950/extras/28346e2b91132a2c6123bbef034e7307.poster.avif?t=1762378561\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984950/extras/28346e2b91132a2c6123bbef034e7307.webm?t=1762378561\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984950/extras/28346e2b91132a2c6123bbef034e7307.mp4?t=1762378561\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3984950?t=1762378561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984950/c55e399c3d8ef2d17a7248edb152380f3db82a95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762378561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984950/a49c2905196f60e4c57e0a3c8ed45930967afd1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762378561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3984950/a49c2905196f60e4c57e0a3c8ed45930967afd1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762378561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"descr